  "description": "Turn up the color and attitude with this Not Your Average Girl PNG.\nThis statement artwork features a fashionable woman in oversized streetwear, colorful sneakers, sunglasses and layered jewelry, surrounded by explosive graffiti paint, butterflies, hearts, lightning bolts and hand-drawn urban accents.\nThe vivid mix of hot pink, turquoise, orange, yellow, purple and black creates a high-energy street-art look designed to stand out on apparel and accessories. The wording “NOT YOUR AVERAGE GIRL” gives the design a confident, independent personality that works especially well for women who love bold fashion and expressive graphics.\nThe artwork combines graffiti style, streetwear fashion, female confidence and colorful pop-art energy in one compact T-shirt-ready composition.\nDigital download includes: 1 PNG file with a transparent background, full-color artwork and no watermark. No physical item will be shipped.\nIdeal for T-shirts, sweatshirts, hoodies, sublimation and DTF printing, tote bags, tumblers, stickers, journals, wall art, birthday gifts and women’s statement apparel.",
